OL,3,AMan killed by tiger died from 'multiple
OL,4,Ainjuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was attacked by a tiger after
OL,7,Fclimbing two fences to enter its
OL,8,Fenclosure at a wildlife park died of
OL,9,F"multiple traumatic injuries", an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FWilliam Chapman visited Yorkshire
OL,13,FWildlife Park near Doncaster on
OL,14,FSaturday and entered the animal's pen.
OL,16,FThe 24-year-old was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene and died of "multiple
OL,18,Ftraumatic injuries and animal
OL,19,Finteraction", the opening of his
OL,20,Finquest at Doncaster Coroner's Court
OL,21,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
